      "updated": 1792780869335,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IP address = the building. Port = the\nflat number.\n\n192.168.1.23:9001 and 192.168.1.23:9002\nare two different flats in the same\nbuilding. Only one program can live in\neach flat.",
